<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s367S"><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p1">Now</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w4">object</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p3">for</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w2">killing</span> is a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w7">sentient being</span>: anything <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s367f1">with</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w5">life</span>. The <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w20"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s367m21">Levels</span> of Practitioners</span> does <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w24">state</span> &quot;<span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w23">another</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w22">living being</span>,&quot; but is only <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w19">referring</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p18">to</span> the fact that, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p11">when</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w8">murderer</span> is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w10">murdering</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w9">himself</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p14">there is</span> a <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w13">wrong deed</span> of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w12">undertaking</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p15">but</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p17">not</span> one of <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s367w16">completion</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s367p25"><span class="nul">Complete terminal SO closes the explanatory statement, represented by its final English period. The full particle record explicitly contains statement-end and period evidence. This is affirmative punctuation fusion, not an uncertain lexical absence.</span></span></span>
